  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup shredded Cheddar cheese",
    "0.75 cup milk",
    "0.5 cup quick cooking oats",
    "1 large egg",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 pound ground beef",
    "0.66666668653488 cup ketchup",
    "0.25 cup packed brown sugar",
    "1.5 teaspoons prepared mustard"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7NR5xIgwyXpbPpDM5iQ2nNZYnww=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15715-mini-meatloaves-VAT-step-01-74b0a8e3bc4140a1becc8411d0bec503.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15715/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir cheese, milk, oats, egg, and salt together in a large bowl. Mix in ground beef until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RfmI4QFHRvzuMCTziGteOqOmUQ0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15715-mini-meatloaves-VAT-step-02-1145e22e36b44531a49be33c2a5f687f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15715/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form mixture into 8 mini meatloaves; place in the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/s9LzG7sieuqJ-z3Q1dOUVZSeaz0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15715-mini-meatloaves-VAT-step-03-63608f1647e94d46af49b5278be47ae7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15715/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ketchup, brown sugar, and mustard in a small bowl; stir well. Spread over each meatloaf.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZTV4swLqJz1tLrtBddqDcXFt3Xw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15715-mini-meatloaves-VAT-step-04-b2e8e1f5a4374567b93bed7dee9d439c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15715/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake uncovered for 45 minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 160 degrees F (72 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BvY4Map3oZCXhNCuCE7EBsZ-ppA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/15715-mini-meatloaves-VAT-step-05-42141b375ba746f0ad06482ebd29cc69.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15715/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy.",
